[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10742.15, "timestamp": "02:59:02", "text": "是的。有趣的是，我尝试做了一件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10747.349, "timestamp": "02:59:07", "text": "像我一样，只做一件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10749.51, "timestamp": "02:59:09", "text": "既然你们就像二维模型一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10751.269, "timestamp": "02:59:11", "text": "你不必这样做。但我只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10754.87, "timestamp": "02:59:14", "text": "例如这个PNG模型。所以我想，我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10757.429, "timestamp": "02:59:17", "text": "做点特别的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10760.23, "timestamp": "02:59:20", "text": "呃，你们聊完之后，我就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10763.67, "timestamp": "02:59:23", "text": "实际上有三个附加组件，但是呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10765.429, "timestamp": "02:59:25", "text": "不幸的是，一切都崩溃了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10767.91, "timestamp": "02:59:27", "text": "结果烧毁了，里面什么都没装。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10770.389, "timestamp": "02:59:30", "text": "所以，我真的必须默认并这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10774.15, "timestamp": "02:59:34", "text": "一切又重新开始了。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10777.19, "timestamp": "02:59:37", "text": "总之，我在前10分钟表现不佳"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10779.75, "timestamp": "02:59:39", "text": "直播持续了几分钟。典型的我的直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10782.23, "timestamp": "02:59:42", "text": "如果你问我的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10784.23, "timestamp": "02:59:44", "text": "等等，我的采集卡不行，但我爱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10786.389, "timestamp": "02:59:46", "text": "缩略图。我喜欢这张缩略图。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10789.91, "timestamp": "02:59:49", "text": "是的。嘿，什么？什么？什么？停止"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10793.75, "timestamp": "02:59:53", "text": "游戏。是的。是的。是的。是的。是的。耶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10797.03, "timestamp": "02:59:57", "text": "我会停止。我的天啊。你必须走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10799.67, "timestamp": "02:59:59", "text": "它不起作用。我勒个去？等待，"}]